# LF everywhere, in the repository AND in every checkout (including Windows).
# Required, not cosmetic: Prisma checksums migration files byte-for-byte, so a
# Windows checkout turning migration.sql into CRLF would not match the bytes a
# Linux server applied. Also keeps Docker/shell files and lockfiles stable.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
